entries[310501] = { ["name"] = "Flexible Ectoplasmic Specs", ["text"] = "2 sec cast 3\nTools: Arclight Spanner , Blacksmith Hammer\nReagents:\nWormfed Gear Assembly (3), Handful of Laestrite Bolts (5), Umbryl (2), Shrouded Cloth (10)\nOptional Reagents:\nProfession:\nShadowlands Engineering (85)\nTrainer:\nMachinist Au'gur\nZone:\nOribos\nCost:\n5\n25\n\nFlexible Ectoplasmic Specs\nBinds when picked up\nHead Cloth\n12 Armor\n+18 Intellect\n+27 Stamina\n+ 18 Random Stat 1\n+ 18 Random Stat 2\nDurability 85 / 85\nEquip: Increases your Shadowlands Engineering by 20.\nUse: Allows you to look far into the distance.\n60\nRequires Shadowlands Engineering\n(1)" }
